<title>USA: Time Warner files $449.4 mln debt shelf.</title>
<headline>Time Warner files $449.4 mln debt shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Time Warner Inc filed Monday with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to register a shelf offering of up to $449.4 million in guaranteed debt securities to be issued by Time Warner Companies Inc.</p>
<p>Together with previously registered securities, the media giant's shelf offering totals $1 billion.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the sale will be used to repurchase, redeem or otherwise repay outstanding debt.</p>
<p>No underwriters were named in the shelf offering.</p>
<p>-- Washington newsroom, ((202-898-8300))</p>
